1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,479
Respiration is the controlled, stepwise oxidation of food inside living cells, to release energy in a form the cell can use.

2
00:00:09,479 --> 00:00:19,114
Burn glucose in a flame and the same energy, about two thousand eight hundred and seventy kilojoules per mole, comes out all at once, as heat.

